<header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Behind the notebook</p><h1>Writing from<br>the margins.</h1><p>Welcome to Signals behind the Margins, an independent journal by Buzz.</p></header><div class="reading-layout"><div class="prose"><h2>Hello, I'm Buzz.</h2><p>I'm interested in writing, tabletop games, and building worlds with something unexpected around the corner.</p><p>This journal is a place for creative experiments, observations, and ideas that are still finding their shape. Some entries are useful at a gaming table. Others begin with an image or a question and see where it leads.</p><h2>What you'll find here</h2><p><strong>Writing</strong> explores stories, atmosphere, and the work of making things. <strong>At the table</strong> gathers game ideas and things to try with a group. <strong>Notebook</strong> is for everything that hasn't found a tidy category.</p><p>Pull up a chair. Follow whichever thread catches your eye.</p><p><a href="/archive/">Explore the journal ↗</a></p></div><aside class="reading-aside"><span class="line-plus" aria-hidden="true"></span><p>Notes - Worlds - Play</p><a href="/feed.xml">Follow via RSS ↗</a></aside></div>
